# Titan 2 Elite on-screen keyboard: with "Keep the emoji picker open after typing an emoji" on (the
# default), the full picker stays open for several emoji and a skin tone; the bar's emoji button
# closes it and the keys type again. Independent of the SYM auto-close settings.
# Needs 😀, 😂 and 👋🏽 visible when the picker opens (recents or the first page) and room for the
# note body above the on-screen keyboard (number row off on the T2E's scaled display).
screen press bar:emoji
wait 800
screen press emoji:😀
wait 300
screen press emoji:😂
expect 😀😂
screen hold emoji:👋🏽
wait 1000
screen release emoji:👋🏽
wait 300
screen press variant:👋🏿
wait 300
screen press emoji:😀
expect 😀😂👋🏿😀
screen press bar:emoji
wait 500
screen press plektra_key_a
expect 😀😂👋🏿😀a
